[gd_scene format=3]

; The Counterweight, over the Coldstacks' roof hatch (map offset (265.5, -37.5)): an old lift shaft cut up through
; the frozen archive to the crypts. Up through the hatch from the galleries, a short landing, and the lift: an iron
; cage on a rope over a sheave out of sight above, an iron weight hanging on the rope's other end. Standing in the cage lets
; go of its brake: it rises the whole shaft while the weight sinks past it, and carries the pilgrim up through the
; floor of the Undercroft. It only rises: nothing climbs back down to it from above; left empty at the top, the cage
; sinks back to wait. Dropping back into the hatch returns to the Coldstacks.

